WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.438 --> 00:00:02.980
STEPHANIE WONG: It's officially
week one of Google Cloud Next

00:00:02.980 --> 00:00:05.847
OnAir, which means we're
focusing on industry insights.

00:00:05.847 --> 00:00:08.180
I'm Stephanie Wong, and welcome
to "This Week in Cloud,"

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:11.700
where we're taking a sneak
peek at this week's content.

00:00:11.700 --> 00:00:14.280
Next OnAir officially
begins tomorrow

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:17.040
at 9:00 AM Pacific time
with Thomas Kurian's opening

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:17.790
keynote.

00:00:17.790 --> 00:00:20.310
If you'd like to hear
the CEO of Google Cloud

00:00:20.310 --> 00:00:22.020
share his insight
on how businesses

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:24.090
can leverage Google
Cloud technology,

00:00:24.090 --> 00:00:26.640
then be sure to add
this to your playlist.

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.370
After that, week one is all
about industry insights,

00:00:29.370 --> 00:00:32.189
meaning we wanted to spend the
first week emphasizing what

00:00:32.189 --> 00:00:33.930
you can do with Google Cloud.

00:00:33.930 --> 00:00:36.210
For that, we've got eight
industry spotlights--

00:00:36.210 --> 00:00:39.450
financial services, health
care and life sciences, gaming,

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:42.610
manufacturing, media and
entertainment, public sector,

00:00:42.610 --> 00:00:44.730
retail, and telecommunications.

00:00:44.730 --> 00:00:47.190
You can hear directly
from organizations

00:00:47.190 --> 00:00:50.430
that have built clever solutions
with a little help from Google

00:00:50.430 --> 00:00:51.390
Cloud.

00:00:51.390 --> 00:00:53.640
One session that I'm
particularly excited about

00:00:53.640 --> 00:00:58.050
is "Reimagining Public
Sector in the COVID-19 Era."

00:00:58.050 --> 00:01:02.160
Pretty much everyone has to plan
around legacy systems, which

00:01:02.160 --> 00:01:04.590
is why I love the idea of
learning how government

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:07.080
and education
institutions adapted when

00:01:07.080 --> 00:01:09.300
faced with a global pandemic.

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:11.880
Roberta Reardon, the New
York State Department

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:14.700
of Labor Commissioner,
will join Mike Daniels,

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:17.520
our VP of Global Public
Sector, in what's

00:01:17.520 --> 00:01:19.620
sure to be an
interesting session.

00:01:19.620 --> 00:01:21.630
So be sure to add
it to your playlist.

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:24.120
And don't forget
to go exploring.

00:01:24.120 --> 00:01:26.940
We've done our best to bring
all the aspects of a conference

00:01:26.940 --> 00:01:28.980
floor into this digital event.

00:01:28.980 --> 00:01:31.260
So be sure to check out
the Digital Showcase, where

00:01:31.260 --> 00:01:34.470
you can find video demos of
how Google Cloud tools can

00:01:34.470 --> 00:01:38.340
help solve the various business
challenges you may be facing.

00:01:38.340 --> 00:01:40.800
We've also got a collection
of interactive demos,

00:01:40.800 --> 00:01:43.290
and even several
learning opportunities,

00:01:43.290 --> 00:01:44.970
all launching tomorrow.

00:01:44.970 --> 00:01:47.302
So have fun wandering
around the website.

00:01:47.302 --> 00:01:49.260
To add these sessions to
your digital playlist,

00:01:49.260 --> 00:01:51.570
check out the links in
the video description.

00:01:51.570 --> 00:01:53.890
Any thoughts or ideas, leave
us a comment or tweet us.

00:01:53.890 --> 00:01:56.510
We'll see you in the cloud.

